1. Web fonts, bundled into the gremion-ui build output and its container image
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

gremion-ui self-hosts its typefaces rather than loading them from a third-party
CDN (no GDPR-relevant third-party request, and nothing blocked by the CSP).
They are imported in gremion-ui/src/routes/+layout.svelte via the @fontsource
packages, so Vite emits the .woff2 files into the build and they ship in the
