2. libipcrypt2, statically linked into the gremion-vector image
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

docker/vector/Dockerfile builds github.com/ipcrypt-std/ipcrypt2 at the pinned
tag 1.1.12 from source and statically links libipcrypt2.a into the `ipcrypt`
binary that the log pipeline uses to pseudonymise client IPs. The binary is
therefore a redistribution of ISC-licensed code, and the notice below must
accompany it.

The upstream licence file is also copied into the image itself, at
/usr/share/doc/ipcrypt2/LICENSE, straight from the pinned source tree — so the
notice reaches whoever receives the image and cannot drift from the version
actually linked.

