Scope of this file
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

It covers what is redistributed INSIDE a built artifact. It is not a dependency
inventory: the npm and container base-image dependencies resolved at build time
carry their own licences in their own trees (node_modules/*/LICENSE), and no
SBOM is generated for them yet.
